  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.11.0 — Transactions.EstimateAsync (POST /v1/transaction/estimate): quote the network fee without signing or broadcasting; the TRON answer breaks the fee down into Energy/EnergyFee, BandwidthFee and ActivationFee, plus FeeExpected/FeeLimit. New EnergyService (TRON energy rental paid from API credits): QuoteAsync, RentAsync, OrderAsync. New NativeService (buy native coin for API credits): QuoteAsync, BuyAsync, OrderAsync. Refused and unresolved energy/native orders now come back as the order itself (HTTP 402/409/502) with a machine-readable ErrorCode instead of a thrown error, so a settled business refusal is not retried as a transient failure; estimate infrastructure failures surface as 502 ESTIMATE_UNAVAILABLE. CI hygiene: .gitattributes pins test-vector checkouts to LF.",
